{"id":"18-harness","number":18,"slug":"harness-engineering","title":"Harness engineering: build the factory","short":"Harness engineering","module":"Scaling up","summary":"Harness engineering means: every time an agent makes a mistake, engineer it out of the system for good. OpenAI used it to ship a million lines with zero hand-written code. Learn the difference between soft and hard constraints, how to make your environment legible to agents, and why lights-off factories still fail.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Mitchell Hashimoto describes his whole approach in one sentence. Anytime you find an agent makes a mistake, you take the time to engineer a solution, such that the agent never makes that mistake again. That's harness engineering.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 18","module":"Module 4 · Scaling up","title":"Harness engineering: *build the factory*","subtitle":"Engineer mistakes out of the system, for good.","bubble":"Never again.","mood":"work"},"start":0.5,"dur":15.149,"words":[{"text":"Mitchell","s":0.8,"e":1.12},{"text":"Hashimoto","s":1.24,"e":1.76},{"text":"describes","s":1.88,"e":2.24},{"text":"his","s":2.32,"e":2.48},{"text":"whole","s":2.56,"e":2.72},{"text":"approach","s":2.88,"e":3.28},{"text":"in","s":3.4,"e":3.52},{"text":"one","s":3.6,"e":3.76},{"text":"sentence.","s":3.84,"e":4.64},{"text":"Anytime","s":4.96,"e":5.36},{"text":"you","s":5.44,"e":5.52},{"text":"find","s":5.6,"e":5.76},{"text":"an","s":5.84,"e":5.92},{"text":"agent","s":6,"e":6.24},{"text":"makes","s":6.32,"e":6.48},{"text":"a","s":6.52,"e":6.56},{"text":"mistake,","s":6.72,"e":7.44},{"text":"you","s":7.52,"e":7.6},{"text":"take","s":7.72,"e":7.84},{"text":"the","s":7.92,"e":8},{"text":"time","s":8.12,"e":8.24},{"text":"to","s":8.32,"e":8.4},{"text":"engineer","s":8.48,"e":8.88},{"text":"a","s":8.92,"e":8.96},{"text":"solution,","s":9.04,"e":9.92},{"text":"such","s":10,"e":10.24},{"text":"that","s":10.32,"e":10.4},{"text":"the","s":10.44,